    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Doubles Event Companion",
    "summary": "Use both guides for Doubles. The Warhammer Event Companion supplies the baseline. Two teammates pool their armies into one force opposite another pair.\n\nMission setup. For Doubles games, this section covers generating missions and laying out the battlefield.\n\nDoubles terminology. This section defines the format’s vocabulary.\n\nTeammate rules. The Doubles Core Rules changes explain how to play with a partner.\n\nConsult the main companion for other guidance, including errata, FAQs and methods for pairing and ranking. Apply those methods to whole teams in Doubles.",
